{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"发展经济学与劳动经济学实证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/economics/economic-modeling/empirical-applications/applications","wordCount":2668,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"发展经济学与劳动经济学实证\">发展经济学与劳动经济学实证</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>发展经济学和劳动经济学是实证方法革命影响最深远的两个领域。前者通过随机对照试验（RCT）的大规模推广彻底改变了政策评估的范式——2019 年诺贝尔经济学奖授予 Banerjee、Duflo 和 Kremer 正是对这一变革的认可。后者则在最低工资、教育回报、移民效应等核心议题上积累了半个多世纪的实证争论，每一轮方法论进步都带来新的实质性发现。本节通过这两个领域的经典案例，展示因果推断方法在真实研究中的完整运用链条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"rct-在发展经济学中的革命\">RCT 在发展经济学中的革命</h3><p>发展经济学长期面临的核心挑战是：贫困的成因是结构性的还是行为性的？传统方法依赖跨国回归（cross-country regression），但遗漏变量问题几乎无法解决——制度质量、地理条件、文化因素等都同时影响经济增长和政策选择。</p>\n<p>Banerjee 和 Duflo 推动的&quot;随机化革命&quot;将研究尺度从国家层面缩小到项目层面，用田野 RCT 回答具体的政策问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[传统发展经济学] --&gt; B[跨国回归]&#10;    B --&gt; C[遗漏变量严重]&#10;    D[RCT 革命] --&gt; E[项目层面随机化]&#10;    E --&gt; F[内部有效性强]&#10;    F --&gt; G[政策可操作性高]&#10;    G --&gt; H[外部有效性争议]\">graph LR\n    A[传统发展经济学] --&gt; B[跨国回归]\n    B --&gt; C[遗漏变量严重]\n    D[RCT 革命] --&gt; E[项目层面随机化]\n    E --&gt; F[内部有效性强]\n    F --&gt; G[政策可操作性高]\n    G --&gt; H[外部有效性争议]</pre><p><strong>经典案例：驱虫药的溢出效应</strong></p>\n<p>Miguel &amp; Kremer (2004) 在肯尼亚的学校驱虫项目中发现了显著的正向溢出效应（spillover）。实验设计的关键是按学校随机分配处理——而非按个人。这意味着处理学校的学生接受驱虫药，但由于寄生虫的传播特性，控制学校的学生也间接受益（寄生虫池减少）。</p>\n<p>估计框架中，总效应被分解为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Total Effect</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mtext>Direct Effect</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>直接接受驱虫药</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mtext>Spillover Effect</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>距离处理学校的外部性</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Total Effect} = \\underbrace{\\text{Direct Effect}}_{\\text{直接接受驱虫药}} + \\underbrace{\\text{Spillover Effect}}_{\\text{距离处理学校的外部性}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total Effect</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0208em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">直接接受驱虫药</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Direct Effect</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2152em;vertical-align:-1.5208em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4792em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">距离处理学校的外部性</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.1576em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Spillover Effect</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5208em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>溢出效应的估计利用了控制学校与处理学校的地理距离变异。距离处理学校越近的控制学校，其学生的出勤率改善越大。这项研究不仅改变了公共卫生政策（全球大规模驱虫计划的推动），也推动了实验设计中溢出效应的理论和方法发展。</p>\n<p><strong>经典案例：微贷款的效果</strong></p>\n<p>Banerjee et al. (2015) 在海得拉巴（印度）的 104 个贫民窟进行了微贷款 RCT，发现微贷款对家庭消费和收入没有显著影响——这与早期观察性研究的乐观结论形成了鲜明对比。关键在于 RCT 消除了选择偏误：自愿申请微贷款的家庭本身就可能更具创业能力和动力。</p>\n<p>这一结果引发了关于 RCT 局限性的深入讨论：微贷款在两年内没有显著效应，是否意味着它真的&quot;无效&quot;？还是时间窗口太短？ATE 为零是否掩盖了显著的异质性？</p>\n<h3 id=\"最低工资争论中的实证策略演进\">最低工资争论中的实证策略演进</h3><p>最低工资对就业的影响是劳动经济学最持久的实证争论之一，也是方法论演进的最佳展示案例。</p>\n<p><strong>第一阶段：跨截面回归</strong>。早期研究用各州最低工资水平和失业率的相关性来推断因果效应。问题显而易见——经济状况好的州可能同时有更高的最低工资和更低的失业率。</p>\n<p><strong>第二阶段：自然实验 DID</strong>。Card &amp; Krueger (1994) 利用新泽西州 1992 年的最低工资上调作为自然实验，以毗邻的宾夕法尼亚州快餐店作为对照组。他们惊人地发现：最低工资上调后新泽西的快餐店就业没有下降，反而略有上升。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>J</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>after</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>J</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>before</mtext></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>after</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>before</mtext></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta}_{DID} = (\\bar{Y}_{NJ,\\text{after}} - \\bar{Y}_{NJ,\\text{before}}) - (\\bar{Y}_{PA,\\text{after}} - \\bar{Y}_{PA,\\text{before}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">after</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">before</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">after</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1062em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">before</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一结论引发了激烈的方法论争论——Neumark &amp; Wascher 质疑数据质量（电话调查 vs. 工资支付记录），Card &amp; Krueger 随后用 BLS 数据复制了结果。</p>\n<p><strong>第三阶段：边界不连续设计</strong>。Dube, Lester &amp; Reich (2010) 提出了更精细的识别策略：比较州界两侧的毗邻县对（contiguous county pairs）。同一州界两侧的县在经济结构上高度相似，但分属不同的最低工资政策区。结果再次支持 Card-Krueger 的结论——最低工资对就业的负面效应在统计上不显著。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>研究</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>主要发现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Card &amp; Krueger (1994)</td>\n<td>DID</td>\n<td>快餐店电话调查</td>\n<td>无负面就业效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Neumark &amp; Wascher (2000)</td>\n<td>DID</td>\n<td>BLS 工资记录</td>\n<td>存在负面就业效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dube, Lester &amp; Reich (2010)</td>\n<td>边界不连续</td>\n<td>QWI/CBP 面板</td>\n<td>无显著负面效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cengiz et al. (2019)</td>\n<td>Bunching</td>\n<td>CPS 微数据</td>\n<td>低工资就业小幅下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"教育回报率的识别难题\">教育回报率的识别难题</h3><p>估计教育的经济回报——一年额外的教育能增加多少收入——是劳动经济学的核心问题。Mincer (1974) 的人力资本收益方程是出发点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln(W_i) = \\alpha + \\beta S_i + \\gamma_1 X_i + \\gamma_2 X_i^2 + \\epsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是教育年限，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是工作经验。OLS 估计的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 受到能力偏误的威胁——高能力个体倾向于接受更多教育，同时也有更高的工资水平。偏误方向通常认为是向上的（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta}_{OLS} &gt; \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>IV 策略</strong>：Angrist &amp; Krueger (1991) 利用出生季度（quarter of birth）作为工具变量。由于义务教育法的年龄门槛规定，一月出生的学生可以比年末出生的学生更早辍学。出生季度满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>相关性</strong>：出生季度影响实际受教育年限（通过义务教育法的合规边际）</li>\n<li><strong>排他性</strong>：出生季度不直接影响工资（需要论证）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>他们估计的 IV 收益率约为 7-8%，与 OLS 接近——这反而引发了争议：如果能力偏误使 OLS 向上偏，为什么 IV 估计没有更小？一个解释是 LATE：IV 估计的是 complier（被义务教育法约束的边际个体）的效应，这些人的教育回报可能高于平均水平。</p>\n<p><strong>双胞胎研究</strong>：Ashenfelter &amp; Krueger (1994) 利用同卵双胞胎消除遗传能力差异。比较双胞胎内的教育年限差异与收入差异，估计教育回报率约为 12-16%——高于 OLS 估计。这可能因为教育年限的测量误差在双胞胎差分中被放大了（衰减偏误加剧）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[教育回报率估计] --&gt; B[OLS: ~10%]&#10;    A --&gt; C[IV 出生季度: ~7-8%]&#10;    A --&gt; D[双胞胎: ~12-16%]&#10;    A --&gt; E[RDD 入学门槛: ~8-10%]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[能力偏误向上]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[LATE 非 ATE]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[测量误差放大]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[局部效应]\">graph TD\n    A[教育回报率估计] --&gt; B[OLS: ~10%]\n    A --&gt; C[IV 出生季度: ~7-8%]\n    A --&gt; D[双胞胎: ~12-16%]\n    A --&gt; E[RDD 入学门槛: ~8-10%]\n    B --&gt; B1[能力偏误向上]\n    C --&gt; C1[LATE 非 ATE]\n    D --&gt; D1[测量误差放大]\n    E --&gt; E1[局部效应]</pre><h3 id=\"移民经济效应的研究范式\">移民经济效应的研究范式</h3><p>移民对本地劳动市场的影响是另一个方法论演进的典型案例。核心问题是：移民涌入是否压低了本地工人的工资？</p>\n<p><strong>传统地区比较法</strong>的问题在于移民的自选择——移民倾向于流入经济条件好的地区，导致移民比例和工资水平正相关的虚假关系。</p>\n<p><strong>自然实验方法</strong>：Card (1990) 利用 1980 年 Mariel Boatlift 事件——古巴突然向美国释放约 125,000 名移民，其中大部分定居在迈阿密。这一&quot;外生冲击&quot;使迈阿密劳动力供给增加约 7%。Card 比较迈阿密与其他城市在事件前后的工资变化，发现低技能工人的工资并未显著下降。</p>\n<p><strong>争论升级</strong>：Borjas (2017) 重新分析了同一事件，但聚焦于更窄的子群——无高中学历的男性工人——发现工资下降约 10-30%。Peri &amp; Yasenov (2019) 质疑 Borjas 的样本选择，指出这一窄子群的样本量极小（约 17-20 人/年），估计量极不稳定。</p>\n<p>这一争论的核心不是统计技巧，而是<strong>研究问题的精确定义</strong>：移民影响的是所有低技能工人，还是仅仅是与移民在技能上最接近的替代群体？答案取决于劳动市场中不同技能群体的替代弹性——这是一个实证和理论都尚未完全解决的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在 Miguel &amp; Kremer (2004) 的驱虫实验中，如果忽略溢出效应，ITT 估计量会高估还是低估真实效应？用潜在结果的语言解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>你想评估中国某城市&quot;人才引进补贴&quot;政策对高技能劳动力流入的影响。讨论为什么简单的 DID 可能不够，以及如何借鉴 Dube et al. (2010) 的边界设计来改进识别。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在 Angrist &amp; Krueger (1991) 的框架中，如果出生季度实际上与家庭社会经济地位相关（例如，高收入家庭更可能在特定季度生育），排他性约束将如何被违反？这会如何影响 IV 估计？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个研究计划：评估外卖骑手大量涌入对本地快递员工资的影响。你会采用什么识别策略？如何解决自选择问题？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Banerjee, A. V. &amp; Duflo, E. (2011)</strong>. <em>Poor Economics</em>. 用通俗语言讲述田野实验如何改变发展经济学的思维方式。</li>\n<li><strong>Card, D. &amp; Krueger, A. B. (1995)</strong>. <em>Myth and Measurement: The New Economics of the Minimum Wage</em>. 最低工资实证研究的奠基之作。</li>\n<li><strong>Angrist, J. D. &amp; Krueger, A. B. (1991)</strong>. &quot;Does Compulsory School Attendance Affect Schooling and Earnings?&quot;. <em>Quarterly Journal of Economics</em>. 教育回报率 IV 估计的经典论文。</li>\n<li><strong>Card, D. (1990)</strong>. &quot;The Impact of the Mariel Boatlift on the Miami Labor Market&quot;. <em>Industrial and Labor Relations Review</em>. 移民自然实验的开山之作。</li>\n<li><strong>Banerjee, A. et al. (2015)</strong>. &quot;The Miracle of Microfinance? Evidence from a Randomized Evaluation&quot;. <em>American Economic Journal: Applied Economics</em>. 微贷款 RCT 的代表性研究。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>发展经济学和劳动经济学的实证研究史就是因果推断方法论的进化史。RCT 在发展经济学中的推广解决了内部有效性问题，但同时引发了关于外部有效性和政策推广性的新讨论。最低工资争论展示了方法论进步如何持续推动实质性结论的修正——从跨截面回归到 DID 再到边界不连续设计，每一次方法改进都带来新的洞见。教育回报率的估计则完美展示了 OLS 偏误、IV 的 LATE 解读和测量误差之间的复杂互动。移民研究提醒我们，识别策略的选择与研究问题的精确定义是不可分割的——同一组数据、同一个事件，不同的问题定义可以导出截然不同的结论。实证经济学的进步不在于找到一个&quot;完美的方法&quot;，而在于让方法选择的假设更加透明、可检验和可争辩。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"发展经济学与劳动经济学实证","id":"发展经济学与劳动经济学实证"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"RCT 在发展经济学中的革命","id":"rct-在发展经济学中的革命"},{"level":3,"text":"最低工资争论中的实证策略演进","id":"最低工资争论中的实证策略演进"},{"level":3,"text":"教育回报率的识别难题","id":"教育回报率的识别难题"},{"level":3,"text":"移民经济效应的研究范式","id":"移民经济效应的研究范式"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据处理与稳健性检验","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/economics/economic-modeling/empirical-applications/core-methods"},"next":null}